      "description": "Open ruled article on the shared stone section surface.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-capability\"><h3>Petroleum trading</h3><p>Sale and purchase of crude oil, fuel oil, gas oil, gasoline and bitumen.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-capability{padding:28px 0 30px;border-top:1px solid #c7cec7;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;background:var(--stone,#eeede7);color:var(--ink,#101e26);font-family:Hanken,Arial,sans-serif}.ds-capability h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}.ds-capability p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted,#5f6a6c);max-width:440px;margin:0}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-capability h3{font-size:20px}.ds-capability p{font-size:13px}}@media(max-width:540px){.ds-capability{padding:24px 0;gap:13px}.ds-capability h3{font-size:22px}.ds-capability p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.95}}"
